    kind: "Speaker",
    role: "Filmmaker · Researcher · Educator · Founder, Artist's Log",
    photo: "/people/eva-ziemsen.jpg",
    bio: "Award-winning filmmaker, researcher and educator with 25 years of experience, and founder of Artist's Log, which helps artists document their creative process, with or without AI. Her work explores responsible AI adoption, ethics and IP, virtual production and immersive education. She coordinates the Bachelor of Film & Media Production at Humber Polytechnic and writes Artist in the Loop, a newsletter on AI, virtual production and the future of filmmaking.",
  },
